# Key script for tools/check_weapon_types.sh, INCURSION_WEAPONTYPE_PROBE=augment.
#
# The probe calls Character::CraftItem (Augment) three times, once per item:
# a short bow, a crossbow bolt, a long sword. It hides every other item from the
# candidate list, so the item under test is menu entry [a]. Each call takes:
#   q    "Add quality" at the Add quality or improve plus? prompt
#   a    the one candidate
# then the quality menu is on screen and is dumped; ESC leaves it. The check
# reads each dump. There is no @expect: a bow that is not a candidate must make
# the check FAIL, and an @expect that misses ends the run with exit 6, which the
# harness reads as "nothing measured".
q
a
@dump:augment-1-short-bow
ESC
q
a
@dump:augment-2-crossbow-bolt
ESC
q
a
@dump:augment-3-long-sword
ESC
s
